Third-party software

The pagewire container images also contain third-party software under its
own licences. THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md in the source repository
(https://github.com/ThePhaseless/pagewire) lists it per image, with each
component's licence and where to get its source. Inside the images the
licence texts are under /licenses (control plane), /usr/share/licenses and
/usr/share/doc/*/copyright (device and driver images). The device and driver
images also hold this file and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md in /usr/share/pagewire/,
and /usr/share/pagewire/SOURCES names the image that holds their
corresponding source.

The control-plane image links libjpeg-turbo, and the device and driver images
contain it. This software is based in part on the work of the Independent
JPEG Group.

